{"title":"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_4\">Problem 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/d/76d15d808807bfa561e72dc8111649ed0a204ebe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$78$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is divided into three parts which are proportional to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/6/8163da82dff559457760e8c093646f6ff5b7d76e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1, \\frac13, \\frac16,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"55\" height=\"37\" /> the middle part is:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/9/659f7abd7e7e0669e0dd4a4dfb64dfedeef4389f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 9\\frac13 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 13\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 17\\frac13 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 18\\frac13\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"424\" height=\"37\" />     \n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the part proportional to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> equal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. Then, the parts are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/6/fa64b9ffc4cef831c68f460bf684ef48ae079403.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x, \\frac{1}{3}x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"41\" height=\"37\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/5/dc57c2c8b1fabe5cf73ad5899e8db0759f92a231.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{6}x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"23\" height=\"37\" />. The sum of these parts should be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/d/76d15d808807bfa561e72dc8111649ed0a204ebe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$78$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/b/9fbab9f738a28e401dae645a6edade5810065949.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9}{6}x=1\\frac{1}{2}x=78$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"122\" height=\"37\" />. Solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/f/33fec5f448425bbd7d6c7b775f51da9d21c7b5dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=52$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />. The middle part is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/1/da1bb9c169ddba5c7fe4473d8780c7402eff24b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3}x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"23\" height=\"37\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/f/68f36042a1c3462fdd1fb72ff30dace112258183.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17\\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"29\" height=\"37\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/9/0b9b68aaa5462a2128fb5d06e10449ebc58b641f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{C}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"25\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME\" title=\"1959 AHSME\">1959 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1959 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1959\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\